{"id":"0d27d2c0bdcc7452","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-vKF.md","title":"vKF理论 (经典KF变体)","display":"df-vKF — vKF理论 (经典KF变体)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-vKF","aliases":["91-df-vKF","91-df-variant-KF"],"display":"df-vKF — vKF理论 (经典KF变体)","depends_on":["[[91-df-KF]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-vKF"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-vKF</span><span>91-df-variant-KF</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-vKF — vKF理论 (经典KF变体)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-vKF-—-vKF理论（完备性变体）$\\mathrm{vKF}$\">df-vKF — vKF理论（完备性变体）<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{vKF}\">\\(\\mathrm{vKF}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> (Kripke-Feferman理论, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span> (扩展语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)\\)</span>\n(<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 句子编码的算术谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(x)\\)</span> (返回否定句编码的原始递归函数)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{COMP}_{T}\\coloneqq\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)\n\\rightarrow\n(T(x)\\lor T(\\operatorname{neg}(x)))\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{COMP}_{T}\\coloneqq\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)\n\\rightarrow\n(T(x)\\lor T(\\operatorname{neg}(x)))\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vKF}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{vKF}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}\\bigl(\\mathrm{KF}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{COMP}_{T}\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vKF}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{vKF}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}\\bigl(\\mathrm{KF}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{COMP}_{T}\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{vKF}\">\\(\\mathrm{vKF}\\)</span> : vKF理论（KF的经典化变体）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本原子把并非统一标准记号的名称 vKF 明确约定为\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}+\\mathrm{COMP}_{T}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}+\\mathrm{COMP}_{T}\\)</span>。在 KF 的经典背景逻辑中，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(x)\\lor T(\\operatorname{neg}(x))\">\\(T(x)\\lor T(\\operatorname{neg}(x))\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(x)\\to T(\\operatorname{neg}(x))\">\\(\\neg T(x)\\to T(\\operatorname{neg}(x))\\)</span> 等价。COMP 排除真值间隙；\n它不是“恢复背景经典逻辑”，因为 KF 本来就以经典逻辑表述。</p>\n<p>与KF的区别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>KF 的真理谓词允许间隙或过剩</li>\n<li>vKF 排除间隙，但不排除过剩</li>\n<li>与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}+\\mathrm{CONS}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}+\\mathrm{CONS}\\)</span> 不同，vKF 的预期真理外延可不一致</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一致性分析：\n理论的语法一致性、算术强度以及与其他变体的比较都需要独立定理；不能由 COMP 的定义断言“介于 KF 和 FS 之间”。同时加入 CONS 与 COMP 则会强迫真理谓词二值完备，需特别检查与自指公理的相容性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-vKF-—-vKF理论（完备性变体）$\\mathrm{vKF}$","text":"df-vKF — vKF理论（完备性变体）$\\mathrm{vKF}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KF}$ (Kripke-Feferman理论, see [[91-df-KF]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{vKF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{COMP}_{T}\\coloneqq\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)\n\\rightarrow\n(T(x)\\lor T(\\operatorname{neg}(x)))\\bigr),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vKF}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{vKF}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}\\bigl(\\mathrm{KF}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{COMP}_{T}\\}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{vKF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}+\\mathrm{COMP}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"T(x)\\lor T(\\operatorname{neg}(x))","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg T(x)\\to T(\\operatorname{neg}(x))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}+\\mathrm{CONS}","display":false}],"bytes":1774,"backlinks":[{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-vKF]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-vKF]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文